{"789610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Splash Adventure: The Maze of Morla", "steam_appid": 789610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [822350], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maze Of Morla</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/2c94f9f6a215f42647decd01316f5eef.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/2c94f9f6a215f42647decd01316f5eef.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/2c94f9f6a215f42647decd01316f5eef.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/06fc202bbadc955577df64720a571bb7.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/06fc202bbadc955577df64720a571bb7.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/06fc202bbadc955577df64720a571bb7.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly maze designed by the evil Morla to push Floti Tank to the limit, you will encounter obstacles, some of them destroyable with your powerful bullets, deadly traps that will make you explode in a literal way, enemies decided to hunt you down and a numerous of creative surprises that Morla prepared just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/ba0100bbef569d0334aca2b3f58b43f3.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/ba0100bbef569d0334aca2b3f58b43f3.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/ba0100bbef569d0334aca2b3f58b43f3.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Floti Tank&quot; has been in many wars and all he wants is some vacations in a nice hotel, with cocktails and beautiful Waifu Ayumi. But &quot;Morla&quot; thinks different and has sent him to his deadly maze in the beautiful caribbean sea, full of traps, bombs, cannons, sharks, pirates and of course.. tentacles. But fear not, as he won`t be alone, Waifu Ayumi will be on the &quot;Waifu Cam&quot; supporting him from the distance and expecting an amazing performance from him ~Nya~ ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waifu Cam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/9413ac9abe39b07c2b99eef8cef7f27a.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=240 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/9413ac9abe39b07c2b99eef8cef7f27a.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/9413ac9abe39b07c2b99eef8cef7f27a.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cam displaying Waifu Ayumi in full body, reacting to your performance in the game while wearing her small bikini, what reaction will you be able to cause on her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Waifu Cam.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Small Bikini.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3D Sexy Waifu with cute personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deadly Maze full of traps, obstacles and enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast phased gameplay full of action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intense final boss battle with Morla.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~nya~</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maze Of Morla</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/2c94f9f6a215f42647decd01316f5eef.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/2c94f9f6a215f42647decd01316f5eef.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/2c94f9f6a215f42647decd01316f5eef.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/06fc202bbadc955577df64720a571bb7.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/06fc202bbadc955577df64720a571bb7.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/06fc202bbadc955577df64720a571bb7.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly maze designed by the evil Morla to push Floti Tank to the limit, you will encounter obstacles, some of them destroyable with your powerful bullets, deadly traps that will make you explode in a literal way, enemies decided to hunt you down and a numerous of creative surprises that Morla prepared just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/ba0100bbef569d0334aca2b3f58b43f3.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/ba0100bbef569d0334aca2b3f58b43f3.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/ba0100bbef569d0334aca2b3f58b43f3.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Floti Tank&quot; has been in many wars and all he wants is some vacations in a nice hotel, with cocktails and beautiful Waifu Ayumi. But &quot;Morla&quot; thinks different and has sent him to his deadly maze in the beautiful caribbean sea, full of traps, bombs, cannons, sharks, pirates and of course.. tentacles. But fear not, as he won`t be alone, Waifu Ayumi will be on the &quot;Waifu Cam&quot; supporting him from the distance and expecting an amazing performance from him ~Nya~ ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waifu Cam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/9413ac9abe39b07c2b99eef8cef7f27a.poster.avif?t=1776868373\" width=240 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/9413ac9abe39b07c2b99eef8cef7f27a.webm?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/extras/9413ac9abe39b07c2b99eef8cef7f27a.mp4?t=1776868373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cam displaying Waifu Ayumi in full body, reacting to your performance in the game while wearing her small bikini, what reaction will you be able to cause on her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Waifu Cam.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Small Bikini.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3D Sexy Waifu with cute personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deadly Maze full of traps, obstacles and enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast phased gameplay full of action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intense final boss battle with Morla.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~nya~</p>", "short_description": "TOP-DOWN ARCADE: Manage LIMITED AMMO to blast OBSTACLES, master the DASH to dodge traps and escape a RELENTLESS CAMERA! Rescue your REACTIVE WAIFU across 40 HANDCRAFTED LEVELS and face the FINAL BOSS. One mistake sends you BACK TO LEVEL 1 in this high-stakes oceanic race!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Vale la pena? Sí.”<br>Vale la pena?<br><br>“Splash Adventure: The Maze of Morla is challenging game, where you have to solve puzzles in tank on water.”<br>IndieWorld<br><br>“Pretty challenging game with puzzles and Anime Girls. What else is needed for life? (We are now talking, of course, about Anime Girls, not puzzles)”<br>GGCurator<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/header.jpg?t=1776868373", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776868373", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776868373", "website": "https://www.facebook.com/MorlaGames", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2GHz or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000, Geforce 9500GT, Radeon HD 3650 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectSound-compatible sound card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Morla Games 2018.", "developers": ["Morla Games"], "publishers": ["Morla Games"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 299, "final": 239, "discount_percent": 20, "initial_formatted": "$2.99", "final_formatted": "$2.39"}, "packages": [238808], "package_group